 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "TRADER"
   ],
   "text": "Kollamkara Raja is entertaining foreign visitors. Men with pale faces and boxes of cloth.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "TRADER"
   ],
   "text": "They come up the river at night.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Dutch?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "TRADER"
   ],
   "text": "Their ships sit off the coast these days with papers instead of cannons. But their smaller craft still wander.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "TRADER"
   ],
   "text": "Company men do not forget how to look for gaps.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Kollamkara sits near Padmini's northern edge.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If he tilts too far toward Dutch coin, they will have a foothold behind our forts.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You wanted a frontier. Here it is.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Go and see whether this raja needs reminding who sharpens his sword.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "My lands lie between you and his. I would rather be there when your men look for grazing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "madurai_troop",
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "War does not stop for this.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "This does not stop for war either.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Now we go remind men outside these walls that she is not the only one watching.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "He wants us to know. He is not hiding this.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "He wants the Maharaja to see Dutch colour in his quarrel.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If we strike him, he can tell other chiefs that we did it at the Dutch's bidding.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And if we do not, he can tell the Dutch we fear their anger.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Raja.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "Pillai. We heard the Maharaja had given a Maratha his Kayamkulam frontier.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "Nice of him to send you to announce yourself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You block the king's road. That is one way to greet his officer.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "I block no one's road. I sit on mine.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "If the king wishes to pass, his horse can step around me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And if Dutch coin passes along this road at night? Does that belong to you as well?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "Dutch coin spends in our markets. As does Marakkar coin. As does Brahmin coin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The grain you send north does not ask whose hand dropped the money it buys. Why should I?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The king does not object to trade. He objects to men using foreign guns to settle local quarrels.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Travancore men lie dead on that road you raided. Their powder has company smell on it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That is not trade. That is provocation.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "They took more than their due. The new walls demand more from us than the old ones did.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "If the king wants to tighten his hand, he should expect us to wriggle.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "If you wriggle into Dutch arms, do not be surprised when their grip leaves marks.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "You come here with horse and muskets and speak as if we are children.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "You forget that my men bled at Colachel too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We do not forget. Which is why the king sent me to talk before cannons.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We are giving you the courtesy of argument first. Do not mistake it for fear.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (inset, past)"
   ],
   "text": "If you fight them, you fight me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (inset, past)"
   ],
   "text": "When you come to their aid, you spill your blood on my soil. Do not forget whose ground you stand on.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "What do you want, Pillai?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Your men off the road. Your promise that you will not use Dutch muskets on Travancore caravans.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And if company men come again, they come as merchants, not as your private army.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "And what does the king give?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The same thing he gave at Colachel.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Proof that when Dutch turn from coins to guns, they find more sand in their mouths than pepper.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "You speak well for a man from the hills. Too well. It makes me suspect you have Ramayyan's ink on your tongue.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I have my own words. He just helps me keep track of where they land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "kollamkara",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "Stand aside. Let the king's horse pass.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KOLLAMKARA"
   ],
   "text": "Only fools stand in front of a cannon to prove a point.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kollamkara"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "That was not the last of him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "No. But it is not today.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He could not strike at the king. So he struck at me instead.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He thinks you will hesitate to chase him into his own scrub.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "Your Deccan tricks work in these hills too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Without you on that flank, half my plans would be corpses in the road.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Remember that when the king counts whose men bled here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "If we go in there blind, we will bleed for every shrub.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He chose this ground for that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He thinks you will either rush in and lose men or pull back and let him claim he held you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "We do neither.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We do not need to kill them all. Just remind them that this terrain does not belong only to them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "BOY"
   ],
   "text": "Mercy!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Mercy is for men who stay on their own land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan!",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "Look at him. He is a boy. He is beaten.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He is an enemy.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "He is not the Portuguese. We are not at Colachel, fighting white devils. These are men of the soil.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "Kill him if you must, but do not butcher him like a dog.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Go. Run before I remember who I am.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You were thorough.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They will not come back.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "No. Ghosts rarely raid.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. War is not a place for half-measures.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "This report. It makes for... vivid reading.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We secured the border.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You secured a massacre.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We sent you to deter a chieftain, Pillai. Not to paint the rocks with the entrails of his farmers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "They were armed. They were raiders.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They were potential subjects. Or at least, men whose cousins pay us tax.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The market says the King's new Maratha captain is a butcher. That he enjoys the kill too much.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It... got out of hand. The fighting was close. Confused. I lost myself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You are a commander. You do not get the luxury of losing yourself. That is for foot soldiers and berserkers.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I apologise, Your Highness. It will not happen again.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It better not.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He has nothing to apologise for.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "They burned my fields. They took foreign money to threaten our flank. Ananthan did what was necessary.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "If the price of safety is a few bloody rocks, I will pay it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We do not ask you to pay it, Amma. We ask you to remember that we are building a kingdom, not a graveyard.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Sometimes they are the same thing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I will not stand here and be scolded for surviving.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Go, Ananthan. Clean yourself up.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "And pray that the next rumour speaks of your discipline, not your thirst.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not let their scolding fool you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It was not scolding. It was judgment.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "In public. Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I went back to the king's rooms. Their doors do not hold words as well as stone holds arrows.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The king asked if Kollamkara would raid that valley again. Ramayyan said no. Not after what the Maratha did to the last ones.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The king said a kingdom cannot be run by butchers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Then he said it is very useful to have a man the enemy believes is one. \"Let them fear the Tiger's claws.\"",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "They will shame you when eyes are watching, and they will praise you when they want you sharp.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not let their need become your hunger.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Highness!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I am fine. Check the boy.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The Prince is unharmed.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "prince"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Well?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "A chaver. From the north. A mark on his dagger hilt, and gold in his waist pouch that speaks of Kochi mints.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "But the style... the hatred...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Say it.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Thampi. One of the sons who fled. The brothers are dead, but their hate breeds in exile.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They struck at the child. They did not come for me, a man who can fight.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They came for the future.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Listen to me, Dalawa. And you, Pillai.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I want a squad. Not soldiers. Chavers of our own. Or men who have forgotten how to sleep.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "To guard the Prince?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-03",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "No. To hunt.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Go north. Find where these sons hide.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Find their wives. Find their children. Find anyone who carries a drop of Thampi blood.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Highness, the political fallout...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "There will be no politics. Because there will be no one left to complain.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I want them gone, Ramayyan. Root and branch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If a babe in arms carries that name, I want it silenced.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-22-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "But... just days ago, you spoke against butchery.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-22-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "That was war, Pillai. War has rules. Men fight for land, for coin, for duty.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-22-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "This? This is not war. This is a weed trying to strangle my sapling. And for weeds, there is no treaty. There is only fire.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-22-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Kill them all. And when you are done, bring me the rings from their fingers so I know my nephew is safe.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-22-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The Tiger has teeth.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-22-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And claws.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-22-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "God help anyone who thinks they can clip them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  }
 ]
}